Package: TempConvAllEG
Title: Convert Temperatures Between Fahrenheit, Celsius, and Kelvin
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Echo", "Ge", , "gee@vcu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides six functions to convert temperatures among
    Fahrenheit, Celsius, and Kelvin. Kelvin conversions use
    the formula K = C + 273.
